{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"Kukudh soars down, cawing, and speaks in Sabrine's voice, 'Look who's back.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:37:03.611000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865165057139015702","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"\"Hi Kukudh, hi Sab. Good to see you again. How are things?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:38:00.921000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865165297513005067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"'We are fine, thank you. Your meditation?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:38:51.426000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865165509346721792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"\"Done, I hope. I didn't want to interrupt Mender's trance, but I'm sure he knows I was there. I met Grimlock along the way as I was going through Hampstead to get out before curfew, I ran with her to Murry Park. She had someone's body, I left it at the park.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:40:57.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865166038652289026","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"'Bodies and bodies... I encountered someone like me in the sewers, and Seraxa is looking for items in what I believe to be the same manner as for Apgan, so... someone must have died. A lot of things about nature are required, so I thought you might be able to help.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:42:27.385000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865166415144681493","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"\"Nature, huh. You know I've been more about machines than nature for a while now. I may remember some things, but not much. What's needed?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:43:34.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865166698466639882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"'Some things I am unsure of the definition of, I thought you may have old memories. Let me see...'","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:44:46.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865166997132935179","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"'Do you know what hemlockroot is? Or what 'flowers not picked but found' may mean?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:46:01.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865167311791063040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"'It also requires the hair of a survivalist... I apparently do not count for this, you were my next thought but I may have misunderstood the term.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:46:33.569000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865167447716134922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
